    "Description": "The libsoup packages provide an HTTP client and server library for GNOME.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libsoup: libsoup: Heap buffer overflow from WebSocket Pong signal type confusion (CVE-2026-102556)\n\n* libsoup: libsoup: Heap buffer overflow during WebSocket message reassembly (CVE-2026-102557)\n\n* libsoup: libsoup: Heap buffer overflow during WebSocket receive-buffer growth (CVE-2026-102558)\n\n* libsoup: libsoup: Heap buffer overflow during WebSocket client-frame masking (CVE-2026-102559)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
